===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ʌnˈd͡ʒʌstli/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-unjustly.ogg|a=US}}
* {{hyph|en|un|just|ly}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In an [[unjust]] [[manner#Noun|manner]].
#: {{synonyms|en|unfairly}}
#: {{antonyms|en|fairly|justly}}
#: {{ux|en|'''unjustly''' punished}}
#* {{RQ:John Heywood Spider|chapter=24|page=110|passage=Nowe is iuſte iuſtice, ſo iotted out of iointe, / That ye here '''vniuſtely''', ſtande at deniall, / To do me iuſtice, and wolde by power ryall: / Directe mine acquitall or condemnacion, / Euen as wyll in both: weith your acceptacion.}}
